    "title": "BeadMaster 6\"",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p>AVAILABLE FOR SHIPPING, OR PICKUP IN: Wisconsin year-round, Arizona Jan/Feb</p>\n\n\n\n<p>?It's very easy and quick to make calibrated exact beads in seconds with the new Beadmaster from Rhino Lapidary.</p> \n\n\n\n<p>SUPER FAST! This machine creates a perfect sphere from a preform in only 8 seconds!</p>\n\n\n\n<p>The machine use 6” diameter, 1/2\" thick wheels.</p>\n\n<p>Bead sizes are 4-6-8-10-12 mm</p>\n\n<p>Electricity: 110V 60Hz</p>\n\n<p>Motor: 0.55 kW monophase 3000rpm</p>\n\n<p>Special sensor for bead rolling wheel</p>\n\n<p>Cooling: circulating tap water</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Wheels: 6” diameter, 1” arbor hole diameter</p>\n\n<p>Dimensions: 20” x 24” x 16”</p>\n\n<p>Weight: 70 Lb.</p>\n\n<p>Packed safely in a wooden pallet box</p>",
